{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>To Seir</b> Three times in the Masorah: אל אדני שעירה · וישב עשו לדרכו שעירה · ועד ההר החלק העולה שעירה. As it is stated: \"And saviors shall ascend Mount Zion\" etc., and this is: \"until I come to my lord, to Seir.\" ס\"ת אליה. אבא = 4 — alluding that after four exiles He will come to it before the coming of the great and awesome day of HaShem, and then: \"And saviors shall ascend to judge Mount Esau.\""], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 33, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:17:42.052020208Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}